      "id": "bingo-lines",
      "title": {
        "zh-Hant": "賓果連線",
        "en": "Bingo Lines"
      },
      "concept": {
        "zh-Hant": "在 N × N 的格子上依序標記數字，每標一次就檢查橫排、直行、兩條對角線有沒有連成一線，並判斷誰、在第幾步先完成。",
        "en": "Mark numbers on an N × N grid one by one. After each mark, check whether a row, column or either diagonal is complete, and decide who finishes first and when."
      },
      "core": {
        "zh-Hant": "讀入 N × N 卡片 → 建立「數字 → (列, 行)」對照 → 依序標記公布的數字 → 檢查橫排 / 直行 / 兩條對角線 → 依規則（先後、平手、提前結束）輸出結果",
        "en": "Read an N × N card → map each number to (row, col) → mark called numbers in order → check row / column / both diagonals → output by the rules (who is first, ties, stopping early)"
      },
